1	//! Process supervisor and JSON-RPC transport client for TypeScript 7's `tsc --api`.
2	//!
3	//! Standalone: this crate has no dependency on `oxc-react-docgen-core` and nothing in
4	//! the workspace consumes it yet. It exists to satisfy the Lifecycle gate in
5	//! `docs/type-checker-integration.md` ("Gates before it ships") — missing binary,
6	//! unsupported version, timeout, crash, restart storm, malformed/oversized frame,
7	//! partial project failure, shutdown reaping, stale notification — before any of the
8	//! actual `typescript/unstable/*` checker methods get wired up to a merge step.
9	//!
10	//! This crate deliberately has no `crates/core`-style panic containment
11	//! (`panic_guard::contain_panic`): that exists to contain panics from caller-supplied
12	//! closures run on rayon/NAPI boundaries. Nothing here calls an arbitrary caller
13	//! closure — the only untrusted input is bytes from a child process, handled through
14	//! `Result`, never `.unwrap()`/`.expect()`.
15	
16	mod client;
17	mod error;
